---

pg-aje is a PostgreSQL 18.x extension that implements A JSON Extension
(AJE) Views. It provides bidirectional mapping between relational tables
and JSON documents with ETAG-based optimistic concurrency control, using
INSTEAD OF triggers for full INSERT/UPDATE/DELETE support on views that
join multiple tables. It supports composite primary keys, TEXT primary
keys, JSONB columns, multiple nested arrays, and fine-grained annotation-
based access control.

